---
manual: button.without_block
lines: [2866, 2875]
testability: interactive
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  button "OK!"
  button "Are you sure?"
end
----------- test code
before = drawables(Shoes::Drawable).size

find_button("OK!").trigger_click
find_button("Are you sure?").trigger_click

assert_equal before, drawables(Shoes::Drawable).size, "clicking a button with no block adds nothing"
assert_empty dialog_calls, "and opens no dialog"
